# ── DATUM runtime state ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The orchestrator writes its port + per-session bearer token here; the kernel
# writes rolling logs. Neither belongs in source control, and session.json is a
# live credential.
session.json
*.datum-session
logs/
*.log
datum.db
datum.db-shm
datum.db-wal

